kpoint57.md)、[独立G3](https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/blob/main/docs/design/archive/slices/rust-r4abc/g3-independent08.json.bin)、[固定提交](https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/blob/main/docs/design/archive/slices/rust-r4abc/fixed-commit09.json.bin)、[main复核](https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/blob/main/docs/design/archive/slices/rust-r4abc/main-integration10.json.bin)、[原字节归档](https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/blob/main/docs/design/archive/slices/rust-r4abc/archive-origin-map63.json)。\n\n验收：Rust310通过/54历史ignored，Native74套863项，Angular59套411项；必要写故障59项实命中并完整113表回滚/重试，6锁屏障及跨项目锁负例，Linux同构建续跑链/Windows完整原UI。163早期负例仅有界等价复用，原失败/partial/ignored/Native参考不升格。\n\n清理：1004自有行精确清理，3借用原件恢复；两库113表/各529原seed及catalog/ACL精确恢复、两次noop，2对象86B原字节保留、运行副本0；自有API/浏览器/Native/PG停止，卷/private保留，3作者工作树可恢复归档。\n\n不包含完整R4、项目移交、实际成本40、经营验收完工归档、R5–R7、上游作者UI/财务19UI、新机制Native符合性、部署切流或性能。#101/#57保持Open。\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/illusion-tech/poms/issues/102/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/illusion-tech/poms/issues/102/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/illusion-tech/poms/issues/106","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/illusion-tech/poms","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/illusion-tech/poms/issues/106/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/illusion-tech/poms/issues/106/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/illusion-tech/poms/issues/106/events","html_url":"https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/issues/106","id":6190135362,"node_id":"I_kwDORtdXRM8AAAABcPX4Qg","number":106,"title":"[RUST-R4-DEF] 移交与成本事实二批联合迁移28入口","user":{"login":"wangzishi","id":8288105,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyODgxMDU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8288105?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangzishi